matically defined (equation-based transformations), or may rely on external=
 supporting files (grid-based transformations). Certain Projection Engine d=
ata files must be present when you use a grid-based transformation in your =
app; attempting to use a transformation with missing Projection Engine file=
s will cause an error. The API can detect whether the necessary files are a=
vailable on the local file system.</p><aside role=3D"region" aria-labelledb=
y=3D":R5ppean35:" style=3D"--note-accent:#8D4A9B" class=3D"note bg-inherit"=
><header class=3D"me-1 items-center gap-1 float-left inline-flex align-midd=
