tyle=3D"--calcite-icon-color:currentColor"><p>These Projection Engine data =
files are available on the <a href=3D"https://developers.arcgis.com/qt/down=
loads/#projection-engine-data">downloads</a> page.</p></div></aside><p>The =
data files should reside in the Projection Engine location specified in the=
 transformation catalog. To set the Projection Engine location(<code>projec=
tion<wbr>Engine<wbr>Location</code>), you must do so at app startup, before=
 other calls that use the Projection Engine.</p><h4 id=3D"check-for-project=
ion-engine-files" class=3D"group relative" text=3D"Check for Projection Eng=
ine files">Check for Projection Engine files<a href=3D"https://developers.a=
